e":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520510010:1":{"text":"현실 파악이 안 되나? 관이랑 묘지는 어디서 구할 건데?","source_cn":"现实一点，棺材和墓地从哪来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C206B44CA13B03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1520510011:1":{"text":"그... 그건...","source_cn":"这，这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8095D28BEBA93A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1520510011":{"text":"그... 그건...","source_cn":"这，这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8095D28BEBA93A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520510012:0":{"text":"그게... 장인들은 지금 수도관과 도시를 복구하느라 바빠서...","source_cn":"这个……工匠现在都在忙着修建水道、重建城邦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25851497A924C883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1520510014:0":{"text":"그럼 결국 장례를 도와줄 인력이 없다는 말이잖아?","source_cn":"也就是说，抽不出人手来帮忙下葬？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC38123558DC1B50E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520510015:0":{"text":"그럴 바에는 차라리 불로 한 방에...","source_cn":"那么，不如一把火——","status":"matched","hash_xxh